Package: stancer.playground
Title: Interactive Multi-Agent Stance Detection Dashboard
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Andrej", "Pawluczenko", , "a.pawluczenko@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A professional Shiny interface for the {stancer} R package.
    It provides a playground for zero-shot stance detection using
    collaborative multi-agent LLM frameworks. Users can analyze single
    texts or batch-process datasets with customizable expert roles,
    reasoning extraction, and multi-language support.
